{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuWeightTwoRowPositive","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuWeightTwoRowPositive","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuWeightTwoRowNonzero","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Field.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Field.Power","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.BigOperators.Ring.Finset"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.ocneanuWeight_conventionD_pos_of_two_rows","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.ocneanuWeight_conventionD_pos_of_two_rows","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightTwoRowPositive.lean#L65-L99","doc":"**The Ocneanu weight is strictly positive on the at-most-two-row shapes** at convention `D`,\nfor every `q > 0` with `q ≠ 1`.\n\nTogether with `ocneanuWeight_conventionD_eq_zero_of_three_rows`, the convention-`D` weights are\nnonnegative everywhere on `q > 0, q ≠ 1`, with support exactly the shapes of at most two rows. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.pow_sub_one_div_pow_sub_one_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.pow_sub_one_div_pow_sub_one_pos","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightTwoRowPositive.lean#L53-L63","doc":"**`xᵐ − 1` and `xᵏ − 1` have the same sign** for `x > 0`, `x ≠ 1`, `m, k ≥ 1`, so their ratio\nis positive. ","signatureChunk":0}]}